<title>POLAND: BANK KOMUNALNY NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK KOMUNALNY NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.76 vs    0.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.02 vs    0.87</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.48 vs    1.07</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.15 vs    1.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.55 vs    5.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.62 vs    7.32</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.17 vs   11.26</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	31.45 vs   18.55</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
